    "intro": "Name your design business with this **Graphic Design Business Name Generator**: for freelance graphic designers, illustrators and design studios. Pick a style, or add your first name or town.",
    "sections": [],
    "faqs": [
      {
        "question": "How do I check a graphic design business name is free?",
        "answer": "Press Check on any name to see whether it's free as a company, a domain and a social media handle. In the UK, search Companies House; in the US, search your state's business register and the USPTO trade mark search. Check your local area too, as two similar names nearby confuse customers."
      },
      {
        "question": "What should I name my graphic design company?",
        "answer": "Your name is your first piece of work, so clients judge it. Freelancers often use their own name (\"Sarah Rose Design\", \"Designed by Tom\"), which is honest and easy to grow; studios pick a short word they can build a logo around (\"Glyph Studio\") or a clever line (\"Font & Centre Design\"). Make sure it looks good written down and works as an Instagram handle and a domain."
      }
    ]
